close_reason: "tests/concurrency_contract.rs spawns 8 concurrent OS processes that each append 3 comments to one shared item using the per-item lock and its configured wait_ms budget; it asserts every accepted mutation survives in the final item and history stream, and lock-guard sabotage verifies the test fails when the lock is released early."
